    turn.\r\n\u25CF You can discard 1 card, then target 1 monster you control; destroy
    it.\r\n\u25CF If a face-up \"Meklord\" monster(s) you control is destroyed by
    battle or card effect: You can target 1 other face-up Spell/Trap on the field;
    destroy it."
